sequenceDiagram
  participant GA as Grafana_alerting
  participant AG as FastAPI_agent
  participant PG as Postgres
  participant LK as Loki
  participant OL as Ollama
  participant SL as Slack_Incoming

  GA->>AG: POST /hooks/grafana
  Note right of AG: normalize summary optional Slack/Ollama overrides
  AG->>PG: persist incoming_alert_events
  AG->>LK: enrich_grafana_alert query_range
  LK-->>AG: streams or skip reason
  opt Ollama RCA enabled
    AG->>OL: POST /api/chat RCA
    OL-->>AG: RCA text
  end
  AG->>PG: save loki plus rca JSON
  AG->>SL: Block Kit digest
